			:rating "PG-13 - Teens 13 or older" ;
			:rank "5643.0" ;
			:premiered "" ;
			:popularity 2862 ;
			:image_url "https://myanimelist.cdn-dena.com/images/anime/7/81651.jpg" ;
			:favorites 24 ;
			:episodes 1;
			:duration "25 min." ;
			:background "Luger Code 1951 began as a story idea that Haruto Haneki submitted for the Shounen Jump+ &times; Animax Anime Scenario Award contest (少年ジャンプ＋&times;アニマックス アニメシナリオ大賞). The theme of the contest was your original scenario in the image of Shounen Jump. The contest accepted unpublished entries that could be made into a short anime, 30 to 40 minutes in estimated length. Haneki&#039;s scenario won the Grand Prize, winning him 2 million yen, a manga adaptation on Shounen Jump+, and an anime adaptation. Akira Akatsuki, who was one of the judges in the competition, drew the manga.The anime premiered on the Shonen Jump+ website on October 14 at 12:00 a.m. (effectively October 15 at midnight). The anime also ran on the Hikari TV service on October 15 at 8:00 p.m. and on the Animax channel on October 22 at 8:00 p.m. A making-of video aired alongside the anime as a special." ;
			:interested_num "17362" ;
		:title "Luger Code 1951" .

